Buzzinga.

4
00:00:15,111 --> 00:00:16,401
(Sheldon:)Leonard and Penny.

5
00:00:16,571 --> 00:00:17,741
(Sheldon:)-Leonard and Penny.
-Aah!

6
00:00:17,905 --> 00:00:19,735
LEONARD:
What? What, what, what?

7
00:00:22,994 --> 00:00:24,204
[LEONARD & PENNY SIGH]

8
00:00:24,370 --> 00:00:26,250
(Sheldon:)Leonard and Penny.

9
00:00:27,248 --> 00:00:29,378
(Leonard(Waking up as Penny screams):)-What?
-I have good news.

10
00:00:29,542 --> 00:00:31,622
(Leonard:)And you had to barge in
and wake us up...

11
00:00:31,794 --> 00:00:34,584
(Leonard:)-...in the middle of the night?
-Your cell phone was off.

12
00:00:34,755 --> 00:00:37,045
(Leonard:)Because we didn't
wanna be disturbed.

13
00:00:37,925 --> 00:00:40,055
(Sheldon:)That didn't work out, did it?

14
00:00:40,636 --> 00:00:42,426
(Penny:)Sheldon, what do you want?

15
00:00:42,597 --> 00:00:45,807
(Sheldon:)I came to tell you I've got the answer.

16
00:00:46,809 --> 00:00:47,809
(Leonard:)Really?

17
00:00:47,977 --> 00:00:50,057
(Leonard:)You figured out
the graphene problem?

18
00:00:50,229 --> 00:00:55,399
(Sheldon:)No, I'm still hopelessly stuck on that.
But I figured out how to figure it out.

19
00:00:55,568 --> 00:00:58,448
(Penny:)I know I said I could handle
your roommate, but I was wrong.

20
00:00:58,613 --> 00:01:01,023
We have to break up.

